Data and services
-----------------

* The library processes JSON files that the caller produces from third-party
  sources (statistics sites, league websites). It contains no code that
  downloads or parses those pages, and the fixtures used by its tests are
  synthetic. Whoever builds the processed data is responsible for having the
  right to use its sources.
* The YouTube client (package youtubeapi) uses the official YouTube Data API v3
  and is subject to the YouTube API Services Terms of Service.

